<h2>Finding professional support</h2><div class="tw"><table><tr><th>Professional</th><th>Generally</th></tr><tr><td>Psychologist</td><td>Assesses and treats with talking therapies; does not usually prescribe medication</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatrist</td><td>A medical doctor who can diagnose, treat and prescribe</td></tr><tr><td>Counsellor / therapist</td><td>Provides talking support; qualifications vary, so ask about training and registration</td></tr><tr><td>Primary-care doctor</td><td>Often a first step and can refer onward</td></tr></table></div><p>Titles and licensing rules differ by country, so check them locally.</p>
